  Version 20261024.1~sparky9~0 (2026-10-24)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Stereo pictures (MPO, JPS and PNS) open in Gwenview by default (/etc/xdg/kde-mimeapps.list). Their types are
    sub-classes of JPEG and PNG, so without a default KDE picked any JPEG viewer, ImageMagick's display on the A10;
    every other viewer stays one click away in Open With

