  Version 20261014.5~sparky9~0 (2026-10-14)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Widget backgrounds at 91 % alpha, the background only (Daniel: "apply the same opacit to widgets backgrounds, partner - only the background", "same as sunk windows"): the default Plasma style is now Sparky Stereo Oxygen, Oxygen's own with every widget, panel, tooltip and dialog background at 91 %, measured 232/255 in the compositor; Oxygen stays installable
